# ---------- Environment files ----------
# Concrete env files (with real values) are never tracked. The two
# negations un-ignore the committed templates: the generic .env.example
# and the per-environment templates (.env.development.example, etc.)
# added in Prod-readiness Slice 1 / ADR 0002.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example

